537 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 395 0 R
/E (The Smart Expense Splitter and Group Budget Management System is designed to simplify the management of shared expenses among individuals and groups. It enables users to create groups, record expenses, define flexible expense-sharing rules, and track individual contributions efficiently. By automating calculations and maintaining transparent records, the system reduces the complexity and confusion often associated with group financial management.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
538 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 395 0 R
/E (Additionally, the system includes an optimized debt-settlement mechanism that minimizes the number of transactions required between group members. This feature reduces financial friction and simplifies the repayment process. Overall, the proposed solution aims to make group expense management smarter, faster, more transparent, and proactive, enabling users to maintain better control over their shared finances.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
539 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 395 0 R
/E (Unlike traditional expense-splitting applications, the proposed system incorporates intelligent features such as spending-pattern analysis, predictive budget alerts, and what-if budget simulations. By analyzing historical spending data, the system helps users understand their financial behavior, anticipate future expenses, and make informed budgeting decisions. It can also detect unusual spending activities and provide timely notifications to prevent budget overruns.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
