/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 400 0 R
/T (User experience can also be affected by the complexity of managing shared finances across different platforms and payment methods. Many existing expense-management applications provide limited customization, unclear financial summaries, and insufficient budgeting support, making it difficult for users to track their expenses effectively. The lack of intelligent recommendations and personalized financial insights further reduces user engagement. For example, users may continue overspending in certain categories without receiving timely alerts or suggestions because existing systems are not designed to analyze spending patterns and provide proactive financial guidance.)
/E (User experience can also be affected by the complexity of managing shared finances across different platforms and payment methods. Many existing expense-management applications provide limited customization, unclear financial summaries, and insufficient budgeting support, making it difficult for users to track their expenses effectively. The lack of intelligent recommendations and personalized financial insights further reduces user engagement. For example, users may continue overspending in certain categories without receiving timely alerts or suggestions because existing systems are not designed to analyze spending patterns and provide proactive financial guidance.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
