/E (Although several expense-sharing applications are available, most of them focus only on recording expenses and calculating who owes whom. They generally lack advanced features such as budget monitoring, spending-pattern analysis, predictive alerts, and intelligent financial insights. As a result, users may exceed their planned budgets, struggle to identify unusual expenses, and face difficulties in managing group finances effectively.)
