/T (Security and trust represent important challenges in digital expense management systems. Since users frequently handle financial transactions and sensitive personal data, ensuring data privacy and protection is essential. Inadequate security measures can expose users to risks such as unauthorized access, data breaches, and financial fraud. The absence of secure authentication, encryption mechanisms, and reliable access controls can reduce user confidence in the platform. Therefore, implementing robust security features is crucial to safeguard user information, maintain transparency, and build trust in the expense management process.)
/E (Security and trust represent important challenges in digital expense management systems. Since users frequently handle financial transactions and sensitive personal data, ensuring data privacy and protection is essential. Inadequate security measures can expose users to risks such as unauthorized access, data breaches, and financial fraud. The absence of secure authentication, encryption mechanisms, and reliable access controls can reduce user confidence in the platform. Therefore, implementing robust security features is crucial to safeguard user information, maintain transparency, and build trust in the expense management process.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [7]
