/Title (The first step in deployment is installing the necessary software and development tools. Visual Studio Code is used as the development environment, Node.js and npm are installed to support backend development, and PostgreSQL is installed as the database management system. On macOS, PostgreSQL can be installed using Homebrew, while Windows and Linux users can install PostgreSQL through the official installer packages. After installation, the PostgreSQL service is started and verified to ensure that database operations can be performed successfully.)
